{
  "name": "selenium",
  "title": "Selenium WebDriver",
  "doc": "Selenium-style adapter over xcelerate (Python, snake_case). Complete WebDriver + WebElement surface; methods xcelerate cannot express yet are emitted as explicit NotImplementedError stubs.",
